WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.755 --> 00:00:17.958
Looking around the dimly lit hall, Alice spotted a glass table.

2
00:00:19.458 --> 00:00:22.020
On top of it lay a tiny gold key.

3
00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:26.623
"I wonder if this will unlock a door," Alice said as she picked up the key.

4
00:00:30.088 --> 00:00:33.289
She tried the key in every door on both sides of the hall.

5
00:00:41.291 --> 00:00:43.772
It was too small, but Alice didn't give up.

6
00:00:46.393 --> 00:00:50.254
She tried again, and this time she discovered a small curtain.

7
00:00:50.274 --> 00:00:56.936
"This wasn't here before," Alice said, pulling aside the curtain.

8
00:00:57.652 --> 00:01:00.674
Behind it was a door about 15 inches high.

9
00:01:01.495 --> 00:01:04.436
And the tiny gold key fit perfectly!

10
00:01:05.857 --> 00:01:08.019
Alice opened the door and knelt down.

11
00:01:09.259 --> 00:01:12.822
She peered through a small passage to a beautiful garden.

12
00:01:14.143 --> 00:01:18.085
"Wow! That's the loveliest garden I've ever seen!"

13
00:01:18.465 --> 00:01:18.946
she said.

14
00:01:18.966 --> 00:01:22.528
"Look at those flowers and that fountain!"

15
00:01:23.908 --> 00:01:27.209
Alice wanted to wander through the garden, but she was too big.

16
00:01:28.769 --> 00:01:32.510
She wished she could make herself small enough to fit through the door.

17
00:01:32.530 --> 00:01:39.512
"I'm sure I could, if only I knew how to begin," she said.

18
00:01:40.773 --> 00:01:45.814
So many strange things had already happened that nothing seemed impossible anymore.

19
00:01:45.834 --> 00:01:50.095
"There is no point in waiting by the little door," Alice thought.

20
00:01:50.936 --> 00:01:52.276
She headed back to the table.

21
00:01:53.592 --> 00:01:58.435
"Maybe there will be another key or instructions for shrinking myself," Alice said.

22
00:01:59.315 --> 00:02:03.878
Instead she found a bottle, which had definitely not been there before.

23
00:02:04.698 --> 00:02:07.039
Tied around its neck was a paper label.

24
00:02:07.700 --> 00:02:10.781
Drink Me, it said, in large, beautiful letters.

25
00:02:10.801 --> 00:02:14.784
"I'm not going to drink some strange liquid!"

26
00:02:15.184 --> 00:02:15.704
Alice said.

27
00:02:15.724 --> 00:02:17.605
"That could be poison!"

28
00:02:18.766 --> 00:02:22.528
Alice examined the label carefully, but there was no mention of poison.

29
00:02:23.760 --> 00:02:25.881
So she decided to take a sip.

30
00:02:30.144 --> 00:02:31.324
That's delicious."

31
00:02:32.305 --> 00:02:33.465
Alice licked her lips.

32
00:02:33.485 --> 00:02:40.109
"It's like a mixture of cherry tart, pineapple, roast turkey, and buttered toast."

33
00:02:42.330 --> 00:02:46.612
Alice liked the liquid so much that she soon finished the whole bottle.

34
00:02:47.613 --> 00:02:50.515
And then something strange began to happen.

35
00:02:50.535 --> 00:02:52.916
"What an odd feeling."

36
00:02:54.256 --> 00:02:55.477
Alice looked around her.

37
00:02:55.497 --> 00:02:57.639
"I seem to be shrinking."

38
00:03:04.003 --> 00:03:08.846
And indeed Alice was only ten inches high, but she was not upset.

39
00:03:09.787 --> 00:03:13.309
She was now the perfect size to fit through the little door.

40
00:03:13.329 --> 00:03:18.093
Alice was eager to enter the garden, but she waited a few minutes.

41
00:03:18.113 --> 00:03:22.316
"I want to be sure I've finished shrinking," she said.

42
00:03:23.160 --> 00:03:26.362
"What if I keep shrinking until there's nothing left of me?"

43
00:03:27.442 --> 00:03:29.884
Fortunately for Alice, that didn't happen.

44
00:03:31.024 --> 00:03:35.367
So she walked over to the little door, which had mysteriously closed again.

45
00:03:39.369 --> 00:03:41.470
Alice reached in her pocket for the key.

46
00:03:41.490 --> 00:03:44.172
"Oh no!

47
00:03:44.612 --> 00:03:45.993
I left the key on the table!"

48
00:03:46.873 --> 00:03:48.574
Alice raced back to the table.

49
00:03:49.274 --> 00:03:51.936
She could see the key quite clearly through the glass.

50
00:03:52.972 --> 00:03:54.873
But there was no way she could reach it.

51
00:03:56.534 --> 00:04:01.577
Trying to climb one of the glass legs, Alice slid back to the floor.

52
00:04:02.497 --> 00:04:04.378
The leg was so slippery!

53
00:04:08.480 --> 00:04:11.522
Still, she kept trying until she was exhausted.

54
00:04:13.303 --> 00:04:17.245
Alice sat down and cried, but that only lasted for a minute.

55
00:04:17.265 --> 00:04:22.208
"Crying won't help you," Alice said to herself.

56
00:04:23.196 --> 00:04:24.096
She wiped her eyes.

57
00:04:26.457 --> 00:04:28.958
Now there was a glass box under the table!

58
00:04:30.018 --> 00:04:34.420
Inside was a cake with the words Eat Me spelled out in raisins.

59
00:04:34.440 --> 00:04:41.682
"If this cake makes me grow larger, I can reach the key," Alice said.

60
00:04:41.702 --> 00:04:45.343
"If I grow smaller, I can creep under the door.

61
00:04:46.123 --> 00:04:48.244
Either way I'll get into that garden."

62
00:04:50.980 --> 00:04:53.181
Alice took a bite, and nothing happened.

63
00:04:54.262 --> 00:04:58.544
She was very disappointed because she now expected strange things to occur.

64
00:04:58.564 --> 00:05:01.525
"This is a useless cake," Alice said.

65
00:05:02.886 --> 00:05:04.406
But she ate it all anyway.

66
00:05:05.407 --> 00:05:07.608
And then she began to grow.
